    quoteText: '"Real estate represents dreams and investments. I help make those dreams a reality."',
    isExpanded: false,
    isFounder: false
  },
  {
    name: 'Riley Brooks',
    title: 'IMMIGRATION ATTORNEY',
    specialization: 'Specialised in Immigration & Nationality Law',
    image: '/team/riley.jpg',
    quote: 'My passion for immigration law:',
    quoteText: '"Every immigrant has a story. I help them navigate the complex legal system to build their American dream."',
    isExpanded: false,
    isFounder: false
  },
  {
    name: 'Samantha Patel',
    title: 'BANKRUPTCY LAWYER',
    specialization: 'Specialised in Bankruptcy & Insolvency Law',
    image: '/team/samantha.jpg',
    quote: 'How I approach bankruptcy cases:',
    quoteText: '"Bankruptcy isn\'t failure—it\'s a fresh start. I help people rebuild their financial future."',
    isExpanded: false,
    isFounder: false
  },
  {
    name: 'Chris Dawson',
    title: 'INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY ATTORNEY',
    specialization: 'Specialised in Trademark & Patent Law',
    image: '/team/chris.jpg',
    quote: 'My focus on IP protection:',
    quoteText: '"Innovation drives progress. I protect the ideas that change the world."',
    isExpanded: false,
    isFounder: false
  },
  {
    name: 'Morgan Lee',
    title: 'CRIMINAL DEFENSE ATTORNEY',
    specialization: 'Specialised in Criminal Defense & Trial Law',
    image: '/team/morgan.jpg',
    quote: 'My commitment to criminal defense:',
    quoteText: '"Everyone deserves a fair trial and vigorous defense. I fight for justice in every case."',
    isExpanded: false,
    isFounder: false
  }
